{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"wat","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"WebAssembly Text","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for WebAssembly Text (.wat .wast).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"wat","name":"WebAssembly Text","extensions":[".wat",".wast"],"grammar":"grammars/wat.json","lineComment":";;","blockComment":["(;",";)"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"WebAssembly Text","path":"snippets/wat.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/wat.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\(;\",\n      \"end\": \";\\\\)\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \";;.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:[if](?:32|64)|v128|local|global|memory|table|ref)\\\\.[a-z0-9_.]+\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$[A-Za-z0-9_.$!#%&'*+\\\\-/:<=>?@\\\\\\\\^`|~]+\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[()]\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:call_indirect|unreachable|br_table|module|result|global|memory|import|export|return|select|offset|param|local|table|start|br_if|block|align|func|data|elem|type|call|loop|then|else|drop|end|nop|mut|br|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:externref|funcref|anyfunc|v128|i32|i64|f32|f64)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:i32\\\\.add|i32\\\\.sub|i32\\\\.mul)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/wat.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(module\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"func\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(func $${1:name} (export \\\"${1:name}\\\") (param $${2:a} i32) (result i32)\",\n      \"  local.get $${2:a}\",\n      \"  $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An exported function\"\n  },\n  \"Memory\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mem\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(memory (export \\\"memory\\\") ${1:1})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A memory\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# WebAssembly Text\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for WebAssembly Text.\n\n## Files\n\n`.wat`, `.wast`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `;;`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `mod` | A module |\n| `func` | An exported function |\n| `mem` | A memory |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}